<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Dinheiro Infinito - FlexCityMods</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #111;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .card {
      margin: 40px 20px;
      padding: 30px;
      background: #202020;
      border-radius: 18px;
    }

    .money {
      font-size: 70px;
    }

    button {
      background: #00d9ff;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 14px 25px;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="money">💰</div>
    <h1>Dinheiro Infinito</h1>
    <p>FlexCityMods</p>
    <p>Mod de demonstração da nossa loja.</p>
    <button onclick="alert('Mod selecionado!')">
      Usar mod
    </button>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
